nexus (0.2.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * nexus-captive-portal: own setup portal (nexus-portal) in place of
    comitup's web app, running unprivileged as nexus-portal and
    reachable only from the hotspot.
  * nexus-captive-portal: on a fresh board the portal asks for the admin
    (tridex) password before the Wi-Fi list; set by the root helper
    nexus-initpw, which only sets that password while the account is
    locked.
  * nexus-captive-portal: Wi-Fi LED shows the setup state; holding the
    Wi-Fi reset button for 10 s locks tridex, deletes its SSH keys and
    saved Wi-Fi, and reboots into setup (nexus-wifi-button, nexus-
    access-reset).

 -- Carsten Wesp <carsten.wesp@online.de>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:58:24 +0100

